WEBVTT

00:13:29.096 --> 00:13:33.350
by drawing on the knowledge
of our ancestors

00:13:33.392 --> 00:13:37.271
and blending them with the best tools
of the modern world.

00:13:38.272 --> 00:13:40.315
If we take care of the land,

00:13:40.315 --> 00:13:43.610
the land will take care of us forever.

00:13:44.945 --> 00:13:46.405
(In Ilnu-aimun: Thank you).

00:13:46.446 --> 00:13:52.870
(Applause)